Block decomposition: rationally independent blocks -> orbit closure is a
product -> lonely iff EVERY block has a clear point; binding = worst block.

  AP{1..7} margin 1/8 ; drop to 6 differences -> 1/7
  so replacing d7 by an irrational multiple gives min(1/7, 1/2) = 1/7

What is PROVED at threshold 1/8, by block size:
  <=3 : PROVED (2k<n)   4,5,6 : NOT proved   7 : the conjecture
